file tools/mycelium_lapse_true_witness.rish GREEN witness — proves app == awk, reproducibility, conservation, the tamper refusal; the Lapse and cord_bron stand at the door
recommend keep-going the Lapse arc is complete; the highest-Lindy next move is a remember/align fold of the whole Mycelium season (Cord through Lapse) onto REMEMBER (its newest entry stops at the Braid), then a fresh Mycelium journey or another double-seat crux. A served lapse · per-account mint authority · breach renames (cairn-first) · deep debride · seed force-push stay the maintainer's hand.
